and then critics, they did
not deal with the works itself

00:48:24.770 --> 00:48:28.890
in order to see how the world changed,

00:48:28.890 --> 00:48:30.850
how the conscious has changed,

00:48:30.850 --> 00:48:33.880
what are the problems
that affected our lives

00:48:33.880 --> 00:48:38.290
and then mentality after
the war caused by this,

00:48:38.290 --> 00:48:42.140
the radical change and
the defeat and destruction

00:48:47.225 --> 00:48:52.130
that Japan met probably for
the first time in it's history.

00:48:52.130 --> 00:48:53.680
Thank you very much, I'm sorry.

