00:49:31.890 --> 00:49:35.780
made kind of oriented
discussions centered around,

00:49:35.780 --> 00:49:39.793
say the politics and the
nations in the world.

00:49:40.970 --> 00:49:42.650
And I like to

00:49:48.337 --> 00:49:53.337
