which is entitled "The Third
Six," that immediately,

00:50:52.300 --> 00:50:57.300
I think you are reminded of
the Second Six by (indistinct).

00:51:00.589 --> 00:51:01.490
And that is of course,

00:51:01.490 --> 00:51:06.160
that marks the start of the
