norm of heterosexual,

00:51:33.900 --> 00:51:37.010
the relationship of gender.

00:51:37.010 --> 00:51:42.010
And she develops the ideas
into the third possibilities

00:51:43.770 --> 00:51:47.980
of that choice that sexuality
should not be divided

00:51:47.980 --> 00:51:50.200
into two categories,

00:51:50.200 --> 00:51:55.200
but there is a multiple
possibilities for women's sexuality

00:51:57.780 --> 00:52:02.780
beyond this division of child
birth and then the maternity.

00:52:03.550 --> 00:52:06.273
And this is a, a very, very,

00:52:06.273 --> 00:52:11.090
a kind of stimulating discussion
that took place in 1965,

00:52:11.090 --> 00:52:16.090
she was born in Korea and
repatriated in the post war Japan.

