sexuality and also motherhood.

00:54:47.196 --> 00:54:52.196
And she has a very striking
poem called My Tokyo,

00:54:56.570 --> 00:55:00.770
that is situated in the
postwar period of Japan,

00:55:00.770 --> 00:55:05.770
that subterranean territory
of Tokyo, the subway systems,

00:55:06.010 --> 00:55:10.950
which really it's
developed very extensively,

00:55:10.950 --> 00:55:14.030
