00:55:14.030 --> 00:55:17.340
the metaphor for female body.

00:55:17.340 --> 00:55:20.503
And so the outcasts
and then devolutionist,

00:55:21.490 --> 00:55:25.590
and then foreigners go
through the women's bodies

00:55:25.590 --> 00:55:29.677
that really the most of the territories,

00:55:29.677 --> 00:55:32.700
the subterranean territories of Tokyo,

00:55:32.700 --> 00:55:37.210
which has been rebuilt and
then modernized very quickly

00:55:37.210 --> 00:55:39.180
in the post war areas.

00:55:39.180 --> 00:55:43.750
And so she kind of
deconstruct the motherhood,

00:55:43.750 --> 00:55:48.490
not as a child bearing sexuality, but also

00:55:48.490 --> 00:55:53.050
a kind of (indistinct) and a place where

00:55:53.050 --> 00:55:58.050
