00:56:13.100 --> 00:56:16.183
And also her contemporary
(indistinct), also

00:56:21.290 --> 00:56:25.540
the author of the very
important poem of the postwar,

00:56:25.540 --> 00:56:29.050
Japanese modern poetry,
and also the translator

00:56:29.050 --> 00:56:30.187
