00:56:31.900 --> 00:56:36.900
She talks of the absence of fatherhood,

00:56:38.380 --> 00:56:43.380
the God and the existence
which really determines

00:56:46.444 --> 00:56:50.630
the norms of the human
existence and also sexual norms

00:56:50.630 --> 00:56:51.770
and so forth.

00:56:51.770 --> 00:56:53.093
But in other sense,

00:56:54.230 --> 00:56:58.670
what she calls a radical
evil that takes place

00:56:58.670 --> 00:57:02.430
and this concept of radical
evil is taken, I think

00:57:03.750 --> 00:57:04.917
