and then the violence

00:57:21.460 --> 00:57:23.993
in the world, but we
don't know what it is.

00:57:25.182 --> 00:57:29.833
It's the kind of chaos that is displaced

00:57:32.600 --> 00:57:37.600
in the place which hitherto
fatherhood and the national,

00:57:39.110 --> 00:57:42.880
the identity had occupied.

00:57:42.880 --> 00:57:46.180
And hers stories of the poems

