had to face the complete
defeat and the failure

00:58:19.710 --> 00:58:23.760
because of the rights of
the Imperial power in Japan.

00:58:23.760 --> 00:58:28.760
And then (indistinct) is
one of those women who

00:58:30.110 --> 00:58:34.470
