sexual relationship,

00:58:41.100 --> 00:58:46.100
but had the experience of
being betrayed by that desire.

00:58:47.150 --> 00:58:50.530
And in the postwar, a period of Japan,

00:58:50.530 --> 00:58:55.110
she was protected by her legal husband

00:58:55.110 --> 00:58:59.543
together with the daughter of
the extra marital relationship

00:59:02.120 --> 00:59:06.080
protected by the nuclear family system,

00:59:06.080 --> 00:59:09.883
which is also the system,

00:59:11.369 --> 00:59:16.260
the much smaller form of
patriarchal family system,

00:59:16.260 --> 00:59:21.140
but also the system which
is based at the foundation

00:59:21.140 --> 00:59:25.423
of Japanese new economic
development after the war,

00:59:26.670 --> 00:59:31.670
placing Japan and women to a very definite

00:59:33.200 --> 00:59:38.200
sexual world as a housewife
who is in charge of the,

